# The full ANSI/SGR/cursor escape catalog, real and compiling, ported field for field from the old
# `feed/code/ansi/mint.tree` draft (dead syntax, real 362-line catalog — see note/term/feed/03-worked-examples.md).
# ESC (0x1b) has no printable escape in a Term text literal (only \< \> \{ \} \n \r \t \\ are recognized, confirmed
# by reading deck/make/code/compile/mill.ts's unescapeText), so it's built once through @term/seed/code/rune's
# rune-to-text, added for exactly this.

load @term/seed/code/rune
  find rune-to-text

task escape
  like text
  send back
    call rune-to-text(code 27)

task reset-all-modes
  like text
  save esc
    call escape
  send back
    text <{{esc}}[0m>

task set-bold-mode
